        It is not a ranked restaurant list, and it does not carry a table of
        addresses. Seville's bars close for August, for holidays, for family
        reasons and sometimes permanently, and a directory assembled in one year
        and read in another does a reader active harm. What does not go stale is
        how the ordering works, what the dishes are, when to arrive, and which
        markets trade on which days. That is what is here.
      </p>
    </div>

